                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.572/62: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to
                        the Minister in Norway</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Swenson</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1928-06-05T16:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">June 5, 1928—4
                                p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>11. Your 1077, November 5, 1927. Treaty of Friendship, Commerce and Consular
                    Rights between United States and Norway signed here June 5, 1928.<anchor n="32"
                        xml:id="d564-f1"/></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Kellogg</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
